    "detailed_description": "<h1>About Us</h1><p>We are F-Greetings Studio from Chengdu. As a college student, I am clear that due to my limited experience there might be some mistakes and flows. And I develop this game by myself. As producer of this game, I accept criticism. I would appreciate it if you can give me some advice. You can contact me.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942010/extras/4fa769dfa213a91ff68cf0562b447fda.poster.avif?t=1726045137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942010/extras/4fa769dfa213a91ff68cf0562b447fda.webm?t=1726045137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942010/extras/4fa769dfa213a91ff68cf0562b447fda.mp4?t=1726045137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u201cRemember it? Remember it! \u201d I can\u2019t remember anything. Somebody keeps speaking to me: \u201dWhere are you? Where are you? \u201d I need to go into my mind and find myself! I have come to this place named \u201cThe Third Building\u201d. My memory is buried here. \u201cThe Third Building\u201d is a first-person horror game. Play this \u201ccursed\u201d game to find the secrets about me and an indie-game studio in the third building.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942010/extras/8fb08ddbed82b46d8eea4bfb9f797c54.poster.avif?t=1726045137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942010/extras/8fb08ddbed82b46d8eea4bfb9f797c54.webm?t=1726045137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942010/extras/8fb08ddbed82b46d8eea4bfb9f797c54.mp4?t=1726045137\" 